WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.566
Salon and Barber.

2
00:00:01.846 --> 00:00:06.198
Day 51 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the Everyday Life phase.

3
00:00:07.948 --> 00:00:08.972
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.252 --> 00:00:16.484
Today's goal: explain the haircut or service you want, give feedback while it's happening, and ask about prices and products.

5
00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:18.687
Part 1.

6
00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:19.927
Key words.

7
00:00:21.177 --> 00:00:22.521
Here is a quick table:

8
00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:44.903
Word or phrase, and Meaning. trim or cut or short or medium or long: how much to cut. fade or taper or layers or fringe: hair styles. sides or back or top or sideburns or neckline: parts of the head. beard trim or shave or shape: beard services. shampoo or conditioner or hair spa or head massage:

9
00:00:45.183 --> 00:00:57.492
treatments. hair colour or highlights or henna: colouring. facial or manicure or pedicure or waxing or threading: other services. appointment or walk-in: booked or without booking.

10
00:00:58.842 --> 00:00:59.717
Part 2.

11
00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:01.234
Saying what you want.

12
00:01:02.484 --> 00:01:03.871
Just a trim, please.

13
00:01:04.151 --> 00:01:05.708
About one centimetre off.

14
00:01:05.988 --> 00:01:08.825
Short on the sides and back, a bit longer on top.

15
00:01:09.105 --> 00:01:10.471
Not too short, please.

16
00:01:10.751 --> 00:01:12.500
Keep the length, just tidy it up.

17
00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.593
Could you trim my beard and shape it?

18
00:01:14.873 --> 00:01:15.897
Keep it short.

19
00:01:16.177 --> 00:01:17.585
I'd like something like this.

20
00:01:17.865 --> 00:01:18.868
(show a photo).

21
00:01:20.218 --> 00:01:21.114
Part 3.

22
00:01:21.394 --> 00:01:22.973
Feedback during the service.

23
00:01:24.223 --> 00:01:26.121
A little shorter on the sides, please.

24
00:01:26.401 --> 00:01:27.852
That's perfect, thank you.

25
00:01:28.132 --> 00:01:30.137
Please don't use the machine on the top.

26
00:01:30.417 --> 00:01:31.505
Scissors only.

27
00:01:31.785 --> 00:01:33.172
The water is too hot.

28
00:01:33.452 --> 00:01:35.351
No gel or no products, please.

29
00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:37.618
Part 4.

30
00:01:37.898 --> 00:01:39.114
Questions you'll ask.

31
00:01:40.364 --> 00:01:42.753
Do I need an appointment, or can I walk in?

32
00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:44.335
How long is the wait?

33
00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:46.599
How much is a haircut and beard trim?

34
00:01:46.879 --> 00:01:49.033
Which shampoo do you recommend for dandruff?

35
00:01:49.313 --> 00:01:51.596
How often should I get a haircut with this style?

36
00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:53.906
Part 5.

37
00:01:54.186 --> 00:01:56.277
Conversation 1: at the barber.

38
00:01:57.527 --> 00:01:59.553
Here is how the conversation goes.

39
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:00.857
Please sit.

40
00:02:01.137 --> 00:02:02.567
What would you like today?

41
00:02:02.847 --> 00:02:05.193
A haircut and a beard trim, please.

42
00:02:05.473 --> 00:02:07.073
How would you like the haircut?

43
00:02:07.353 --> 00:02:10.895
Short on the sides and back, and a bit longer on top.

44
00:02:11.175 --> 00:02:12.412
Not too short.

45
00:02:12.692 --> 00:02:14.377
With a machine on the sides?

46
00:02:15.727 --> 00:02:17.327
The conversation continues.

47
00:02:17.607 --> 00:02:20.914
Yes, number 3 on the sides, and scissors on top.

48
00:02:21.194 --> 00:02:22.005
Later

49
00:02:22.285 --> 00:02:23.223
How's this?

50
00:02:23.503 --> 00:02:25.829
Could you take a little more off the back?

51
00:02:26.109 --> 00:02:28.370
And make the sideburns a bit shorter.

52
00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:29.354
Sure.

53
00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:30.658
And the beard?

54
00:02:32.008 --> 00:02:33.608
The conversation continues.

55
00:02:33.888 --> 00:02:36.000
Just tidy it up and keep the shape.

56
00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.093
Keep it short on the cheeks.

57
00:02:38.373 --> 00:02:39.205
Done.

58
00:02:39.485 --> 00:02:41.213
Would you like a head massage?

59
00:02:41.493 --> 00:02:42.837
How much is it?

60
00:02:43.117 --> 00:02:45.123
150 rupeesextra.

61
00:02:45.403 --> 00:02:46.811
Okay, go ahead!

62
00:02:48.161 --> 00:02:49.099
Part 6.

63
00:02:49.379 --> 00:02:52.281
Conversation 2: booking at a salon by phone.

64
00:02:53.531 --> 00:02:55.557
Here is how the conversation goes.

65
00:02:55.837 --> 00:02:57.715
Good afternoon, Glow Salon.

66
00:02:57.995 --> 00:03:03.157
Hi, I'd like to book a haircut and a hair spa for my wife on Saturday afternoon.

67
00:03:03.437 --> 00:03:05.315
We have a slot at 3:30.

68
00:03:05.595 --> 00:03:06.811
Is that okay?

69
00:03:07.091 --> 00:03:08.285
Yes, that works.

70
00:03:08.565 --> 00:03:10.976
How much are both services together?

71
00:03:11.256 --> 00:03:13.667
1,800 rupeesfor both.

72
00:03:13.947 --> 00:03:15.867
We have a weekend combo offer.

73
00:03:17.217 --> 00:03:18.817
The conversation continues.

74
00:03:19.097 --> 00:03:19.843
Great.

75
00:03:20.123 --> 00:03:22.086
The booking is under Priya Gupta.

76
00:03:22.366 --> 00:03:23.987
Do you need a phone number?

77
00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:25.377
Yes, please.

78
00:03:25.657 --> 00:03:30.819
98450 12345.

79
00:03:31.099 --> 00:03:31.931
Done.

80
00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:33.897
Please come ten minutes early.

81
00:03:35.247 --> 00:03:36.185
Part 7.

82
00:03:36.465 --> 00:03:37.383
Practice.

83
00:03:38.633 --> 00:03:43.667
Describe your usual haircut in 2 sentences, in English, as you would to a new barber.

84
00:03:45.017 --> 00:03:45.892
Part 8.

85
00:03:46.172 --> 00:03:47.217
Speak today.

86
00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:50.899
Write down your haircut instructions in English.

87
00:03:51.179 --> 00:03:55.659
Learn 3 feedback phrases (a little shorter, that's perfect, not too short).

88
00:03:57.009 --> 00:03:58.545
That's the end of this lesson.

89
00:03:58.825 --> 00:04:03.476
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

90
00:04:03.756 --> 00:04:09.879
For extra practice, paste the Master Prompt into an AI assistant and role-play the conversation.

